      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-85964",
      ":question/problem": "Suppose we wish to study the population of students at a particular high school. Which of the following samples would be biased?\n\n1. A selection of $15$ students who rode a particular bus to school\n2. A selection of $12$ students who were at a basketball game during the evening\n3. A selection of $20$ students randomly chosen from the school's attendance roster"
